    <word key="gddeals_coupon_auto_expire_desc"><![CDATA[When ON, a background task (runs every 15 min) flips <code>expired=1</code> on any coupon whose <code>expires_at</code> is in the past. Front-end widgets ALSO defensively check <code>expires_at</code> directly, so turning this OFF still hides date-expired coupons from customers &mdash; this toggle only disables the batch flag update, not query-time visibility.]]></word>
